{"id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md","title":"Cumulative Hierarchy","display":"df-hierarchy — Cumulative Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hierarchy — Cumulative Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-union]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hierarchy — Cumulative Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a295a90caf70085\" href=\"?note=5a295a90caf70085\" title=\"58-df-union\">58-df-union</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> denotes the set-valued cumulative-hierarchy class term at the ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}zero} \\vdash V_0\\coloneqq\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}zero} \\vdash V_0\\coloneqq\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to V_{\\beta+1}=\\mathcal P(V_\\beta)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to V_{\\beta+1}=\\mathcal P(V_\\beta)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\to V_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}V_\\beta\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\to V_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}V_\\beta\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\alpha}\">\\(V_{\\alpha}\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-th level of the cumulative hierarchy.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_{\\alpha}\">\\(V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_{\\alpha}\\)</span> is the universe of all sets.</li>\n<li>Each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\alpha}\">\\(V_{\\alpha}\\)</span> is transitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-union","status":"resolved","id":"5a295a90caf70085","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is as in [[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}zero} \\vdash V_0\\coloneqq\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}successor} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to V_{\\beta+1}=\\mathcal P(V_\\beta)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\beta+1\\in\\lambda)\\to V_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}V_\\beta\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"V_{\\alpha}","display":false}],"bytes":1153,"backlinks":[{"id":"d99054be830a8adb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V_\\kappa$ (cumulative hierarchy level, see [[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]])"},{"id":"d2875fa6e7542298","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda,j,\\kappa,\\mathcal V_\\lambda\\in V$ and $V_\\lambda\\in V$ is the hierarchy level from [[58-df-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"3a899ab7d4901585","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c65978724aed94dc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V_\\alpha$ (cumulative-hierarchy level, see [[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]])"},{"id":"6994aafd3bf766a5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"26644165863707d2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V_\\gamma$ is the cumulative-hierarchy level from [[58-df-hierarchy]] and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is from [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"},{"id":"909c5efc04dca7f4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dd458e14301e0670","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in V$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the ordinal predicate, and $V_\\alpha$ is the cumulative-hierarchy term from [[58-df-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"6506f34033bb0739","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29c11c38a35d8c1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V_\\alpha,V_\\beta$ (canonical cumulative-hierarchy levels from [[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]])"},{"id":"154d396d8d0ed575","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau)$ (Borel pointcl